  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273224</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……恵み与えし女神の救いを
受けし者よ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thou who receiveth salvation
through the goddess's blessings!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273268</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>な、なに！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wh-What!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>我は天の戦場を駆けし戦乙女</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I am the battle maiden who walks
the battlefields of the heavens.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>女神との盟約により、
我が主の槍、
しばし汝らに預けよう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In accordance with the goddess's
pact, I bestow upon thee, however
briefly, the spear of my master.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>use thee when on the recieving end and not the subject of the sentence. -dragon</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273420</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがたく受け取れ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Receive it with gratitude!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273484</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だ、大丈夫なのか、
これ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Uh, i-is this thing...safe?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは……
グーングニルの槍……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is...Gungnir...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273600</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>グーングニル？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gungnir?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yes...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273692</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわっ……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それは先の戦いの後、
汝の手からは去ったもの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Following your previous battle, this
spear was plucked from thy hands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>今は女神の懇願により
その幼き者たちに
かりそめに与えた力</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now, by the goddess's
entreaty, it has been temporarily
granted to those young ones.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273856</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>汝は触れるでない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thy hands shall not touch it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……その声は……
そうか、わかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This voice is...
...Okay. I get it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……とにかく、
とても強い力が
宿っている槍なんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Anyway, it's an incredibly
powerful spear.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>273992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>使ってみるといいよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You should try using it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Proofreading</Status>
    </Entry>
